        <ol>
<li>
<p><strong>Recycling &amp; Waste Sorting</strong></p>
<p>
In Finland, waste is sorted into bio-waste, plastic, cardboard, glass,
and metal. Learn how to recycle correctly in Oulu.
</p>
<p>
Check out:
<a href="https://kiertokaari.fi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
Kiertokaari
</a>
</p>
